{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1107196-fyi-stewart-wieck","id":1107196,"title":"FYI Stewart Wieck","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-06-23T20:29:05-07:00","id":1107196,"title":"FYI Stewart Wieck","content":"This was posted on Satyros Phil Brucato's Facebook today:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">There are no words. Yet there must be words.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/stewart.wieck?fref=mentions\" target=\"_blank\">Stewart Wieck</a>, the core creator of <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/496367913753429/?fref=mentions\" target=\"_blank\">Mage: The Ascension</a> and the co-creator of White Wolf, its World of Darkness, and so much more - a man whose vast intellect and sense of humor and righteous vision literally saved my life and the lives of anyone who can look to Mage and say, &quot;I am who I am because of this&quot; - died suddenly yesterday at the age of 49.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">When I say that Stew saved my life, I am not speaking figuratively. At the time h<span style=\"font-family:inherit\">e hired me to become the Mage: The Ascension line developer - a job that became a calling, and which I'm still doing almost 25 years later - I was literally suicidal, trapped by a combination of circumstances until there seemed to be no other way out. There WAS one, though, and Stewart gave it to me. I could never, and will never, forget that.</span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">For anyone who has ever held those gigantic purple tomes and reveled in the possibilities and frustrations of Stewart's labor-of-love, raise a glass to the man who first Awakened us all.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">And this should not need to be said, but given recent events I will say it anyway:</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Anyone who has a single bad thing to say about Stewart, Mage, White Wolf or the World of Darkness - this is not the fucking time and not the fucking place.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Rest easy, my old friend, and thank you for all you have done for me, for us, for the world at large.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">We are who we are because of you.</span><br /> </span></span></span> </div> </div> </div>Like Mr Brucato, I can honestly say that &quot;I am who I am because of this&quot; game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12930-gogariglenross","name":"GogariGlenRoss","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12930_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-23T22:03:43-07:00","id":1107208,"title":"","content":"Does anyone know what the hell happened? He was tweeting stuff literally yesterday.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","r